flowchart TD
  accTitle: Simplified qualification before reuse
  accDescr: Observations and sources inform a candidate, which is tested and reviewed before versioning and reevaluation in another context. This is not the exact promotion state machine and grants no execution authority.
  A["Observations and sources"] --> B["Candidate and assumptions"]
  B --> C["Tests, counterexamples and review"]
  C --> D["Versioned knowledge and applicability"]
  D --> E["Reevaluate in the next context"]
  E -->|"New evidence or changed assumptions"| B
